      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Past, present, future... what does this space truly mean to us?\n\n'Meet
    Me in the Cathedral' is an augmented reality experience that explores what this
    heritage means to the people of Christchurch\u2014whoever they are, and wherever
    they come from.\n\nA lost traveler, a former choir member, a foreign visitor...
    Piece by piece, their personal stories weave together the fabric of this special
    place. As you trace the panel fence, you will encounter them, uncovering the
    quiet memories and meanings the Cathedral holds in their hearts."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
