  - title: Your Journey
    content: "01 \u2014 Look Back\nDiscover how the Cathedral has changed through
      historical photographs and 3D reconstruction.\n\n02 \u2014 Step Inside\nExplore
      a glimpse of the Cathedral's inaccessible historical interior through an AR
      portal.\n\n03 \u2014 Discover the Details\nExplore the Cathedral through its
      architecture, sounds and stories."
  - title: How to Explore
    content: "- Follow the POI markers to discover each experience.  \n- Approach
      a marker to activate its story.  \n- Follow the on\u2011screen instructions
      to interact with AR content.  \n- Take your time. There is no rush."
