--- !u!114 &8328906292513212158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4566137446410823698}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6f009757ccd30a4194303a530278bff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterNameText: {fileID: 9195539324709959578}
  dialogueBodyText: {fileID: 5599549490604622058}
  continueButton: {fileID: 6623358728811564165}
  enableFullScreenClick: 1
  debounceAfterSkip: 0.15
  typingSpeed: 0.035
  enablePunctuationPauses: 1
  defaultSpeaker: Susan
  defaultLines:
  - My name is Susan. I grew up and live in Christchurch.Standing here in Cathedral
    Square today, it's quiet... It's different from what I remembered. The tower
    and spire are missing, but they carry my special memories.
  - "When I was at school, I got lost around Cathedral Square during the trip. I
    remember my teacher, Mr Watson, once told us: 'If you are lost, look for the
    Cathedral spire\u2014it's the tallest building in the town!'  I heard the bell,
    looked up, and found my way back."
  - "The last time I saw the spire, I was visiting the square with my homestay student.
    Now, when I pass by here, I still see the absence of that spire. I try to outline
    its contours in my mind... just like lifting my phone to capture it \u2014 it's
    a habit that never left me..."
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
