    - target: {fileID: 7510444409258083804, guid: 702da5c622672dd4e8f383f1b6ccafc5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pageBodies.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Christchurch Cathedral Choir is New Zealand\u2019s only professional
        choir for trebles and adults, and one of two in the southern hemisphere with
        its own choir school. Though the quake silenced the old building, this tradition
        lives on through its junior choristers at the Transitional Cathedral.\n\n_________________________________________\n\nKnow
        more"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7510444409258083804, guid: 702da5c622672dd4e8f383f1b6ccafc5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'pageBodies.Array.data[1]'
      value: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc iaculis
        lectus ac purus rutrum venenatis. Suspendisse potenti. In euismod interdum
        nulla, et posuere justo blandit et. Maecenas eleifend iaculis lacus sagittis
        finibus. Praesent tempor ante sit amet dui fermentum ullamcorper. Donec erat
        velit, euismod eget elit sit amet, congue lacinia massa. Fusce mi mauris,
        imperdiet tristique facilisis et, molestie et ligula. Nam ullamcorper finibus
        bibendum. Etiam laoreet et magna non commodo. Suspendisse euismod ultricies
        tellus, et efficitur massa consectetur quis. Nullam et est a ligula finibus
        pharetra. Ut mattis dui at quam sagittis fringilla. Cras varius bibendum
        porta. Pellentesque rutrum.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
